              "message": "TypeScript: report a workspace that cannot be serialised for a save-only store\n\nWith a store that implements only `save`, the coordinator builds a\nsnapshot of the workspace before each save. When building it threw, the\ncoordinator skipped the save without a word, where every other failed\nwrite is reported to `onStoreError` or printed to stderr. It now reports\nthis one the same way. Nothing is lost: the next save carries the whole\nworkspace. The Python coordinator already reported it.\n\nThe new test makes the snapshot throw for one call, checks that the\nfailure is reported, and checks that the next save restores the same\nworkspace.",
