              "message": "chap-analytics 0.2.4\n\n- The patch applier tells a JSON boolean from a number in a `test`\n  operation, as the coordinators do (#187).\n- The whispers chart and brief say what a lapse records, and what to\n  check when many lapse (#186).\n\nBoth changes are on main already; this commit sets the version and the\nchangelog entry.",
